5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The informal system has collapsed. I need to know the true monthly cost of supplies before we agree to anything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I am concerned about the time burden. I need to verify how long a proper clean actually takes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The current distribution feels unfair. I want to see who is actually using the kitchen versus who is cleaning it.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. I need to understand what ""done"" means to each of us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about our relationships. I want to see how the previous tenants handled this and what went wrong.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the hours are high, we might need to outsource. But I need the supply costs first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
