16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the stopwatch timing and the outside firm's terms. I need the time and cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the kitchen use watch and the absences on the calendar. I need the usage data.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
