35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show 2,300 yen monthly in supplies, often bought twice. The management rate is 4,200 yen per hour.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes 102 minutes. The outside firm requires a two-hour window and a tidy space beforehand.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Two housemates are away most months. The kitchen mess comes from three people, not all five.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"""Done"" varies wildly. The grout re-dirties in eleven days. The standard is inconsistent and the room is hard to keep.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The previous tenants divided rooms permanently and stopped speaking by year two. Our rows started with reminders.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, 102 minutes is significant. At 4,200 yen, an hour of labor is expensive. We need to minimize hours.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, the firm's terms are a trap. We must tidy before they arrive, so we still do the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, the previous tenants' failure confirms my fear. Permanent assignments create resentment.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the grout fails in eleven days, a weekly rota is impossible. We need a different approach.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need a system that doesn't rely on constant reminders. The chat history is a warning.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the firm requires pre-tidying, the cost is just for the final polish. Is that worth it?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, it removes the heavy lifting. The 102 minutes drop to 20 minutes of pre-tidying. That is a win.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, the usage data shows we shouldn't pay equally for a kitchen we barely use. But the bathroom is shared.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, I care about the bathroom. If the grout fails, I need a professional to handle the deep clean.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, I support outsourcing. It removes the friction that caused the previous tenants to stop talking.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The cost is high, but the time saved is valuable. I am leaning towards the service.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The time reduction is the key. I am voting for the service to protect my schedule.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,The usage imbalance makes a rota unfair. The service is the only neutral option.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,The grout issue is too hard for us. I need the professional help.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,Harmony is the priority. The service removes the source of conflict. I am voting for it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
